function f4ActivitiesAdmissionLimits_(uid){const B=f4DevBoundary_();if(!B.permit({environment:'DEV',projectId:B.project,database:B.database}))return null;if(!PropertiesService.getScriptProperties().getProperty('ACT_CORE_DEV_CONFIG'))return null;const m=f4DevTransport_().load();if(!['SYNTHETIC_FUNCTIONAL','DEV_OPERATIONAL'].includes(m.mode))return null;return {counterId:'ACT_'+f4Core_().hash(uid).slice(0,32),maximum:120,limit:m.functional.admissionsPerHour};}
function ACTCoreDevConfigure(m){return f4DevTransport_().configure(m);}
function ACTCoreDevRunJobs(entry,cursor){return f4DevTransport_().runJobs(entry,cursor);}
function ACTCoreDevProbe(){return f4DevTransport_().probe();}
function ACTCoreDevWorker(token,key,worker){return f4DevTransport_().worker(token,key,worker);}
